    displayName: Wind Walker
    rank: D
    parent: 
    description: 'Never still, and never where the enemy strikes. Melee skills have 15% shorter cooldowns. Rising Kick has a 20% shorter cooldown and reaches 1 m further. New skill: Gale Kick (level 16).'
