    displayName: Mountain Breaker
    rank: B
    parent: iron-fist
    description: 'Strikes the ground hard enough to throw a crowd off its feet. Dragon''s Descent deals 30% more damage and covers 1.5 m more around it. Area skills deal 15% more damage. New skills: Earthshaker Fist (level 56), Quaking Palm (level 62).'
