    displayName: Dragon Fist
    rank: B
    parent: iron-fist
    description: 'One perfect strike, gathered and let go. Hundred Palms deals 35% more damage. Physical skills deal 10% more damage. New skills: Dragon Strike (level 56), Coiling Dragon (level 62).'
